{"unit_id":"Ycet__dsh-session-plus#card-zh","repo":"Ycet/dsh-session-plus","commit":"6c532e63599ba523f6458855bf36e9c3e7466063","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-plus（DSH 网页插件）：为会话界面增加模型与输入辅助功能。它通过浏览器侧插槽扩展 DSH，在模型菜单显示当前提供商，并允许把选中的聊天文本作为代码块插入输入框；还提供账户菜单主题切换、推理等级滑条、新建会话页的“在应用中打开”按钮，以及五项可独立关闭的功能开关。适合希望调整网页会话界面和输入流程的 DSH 用户。无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:365-377","lib/client.js:446-460","lib/client.js:1310-1351","lib/client.js:2000-2008"]}
{"unit_id":"Ycet__dsh-session-plus#card-en","repo":"Ycet/dsh-session-plus","commit":"6c532e63599ba523f6458855bf36e9c3e7466063","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-plus is a DSH web plugin that adds provider labels, selected-text insertion, theme controls, a reasoning slider, and an Open In button on new sessions. Five settings let users switch each feature independently. It suits people who want extra session controls; no extra key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:365-377","lib/client.js:446-460","lib/client.js:1310-1351","lib/client.js:2000-2008"]}
